{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dbbae087-bcec-8905-8433-0757714ac7c3",
  "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:23:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Zelia Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:21:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:22:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I am calling about a storm drain. The catch basin at the corner is clogged, full of leaves, and the water is coming back into my driveway. Right now, while it is raining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:22:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:22:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "382 Kingston Avenue. Three eight two. Historic Hill. The drain is at the corner, right near my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:22:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 382 Kingston Avenue, and the basin at the corner is blocked with leaves. Is that the nor'easter water coming in today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:22:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter that is hitting today. It started this morning and the water is already up to the edge of my garage. Leaves are piled on top of the grate. Nobody clean it. I see it was like this for weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:22:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Is the water in the house or just the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:22:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just driveway now. But it is coming higher. My family live on this street four generations, four generations, and this drain always have problem. Always."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:22:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four generations, wow. I'll get this in as an urgent request so a crew can look at it. Crews are stretched during a storm, but it will be flagged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:22:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I take photos, many photos. I can send to you. Where I send?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me get you set up. Do you have an email you can send to the department? Actually, I'll note on the ticket that photos are available, and someone will contact you for them. Is the number you're calling from the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:23:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this cell. Four zero one, five five five, zero one seven five. Zero one seven five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:23:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-five. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:23:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One more question. Is this a city drain or a state one? Somebody tell me before maybe state."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kingston Avenue, that one should be a city street, so the city drain. If it turns out to be state, we'll pass it along ourselves. You won't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:23:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Please, somebody come soon. Before the water is in the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:23:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it marked urgent, Ms. Andrade. Stay safe and keep away from that standing water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
